# Keep shipped file splits

These files were split so one module stays an orchestrator. Do not dump the
extracted bodies back in.

| Keep thin | Lives in |
| --- | --- |
| `DisplayControlBar.tsx` | Public bar, MAIN grid, `syncDisplayControlBar` re-exports |
| `dcbLayouts.ts` | MAIN cell data |
| `dcbChrome.tsx` | `DcbCell`, shared caps, SITE |
| `DisplayControlBarMenus.tsx` | AUX + MAPS/PREF/CHAR/BRITE/… |
| `renderScope.ts` | Draw **order** only: maps → wx → tracks → SSA/lists |
| `renderScopePaint.ts` | Paint stages |
| `previewArea.ts` | Idle/entry/armed, slew apply, keys |
| `previewParse.ts` | Buffer grammar / `parsePreviewCommand` |

DCB clicks still call `@scope` only. Never Command IR from the bar. Re-export
`MAIN_DCB_LAYOUT` from `DisplayControlBar`.

**Do not split** `pattern-matcher.ts` or `scopeKeys.ts` (high-regression
routers). New behavior there stays in those files unless a later ticket says
otherwise.
